                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "57200397-dfef-4657-8742-e6a9dc0db8f1",
                        "entry_id": "cf36fe02-a9a2-307d-b059-82ec121c1063",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "vélos-cargos"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "7b1566bb-5f87-44e1-98d6-772c8245a576",
                        "entry_id": "cf36fe02-a9a2-307d-b059-82ec121c1063",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "vélo cargo"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bcb53acb-730f-38c1-852a-b4e7d835da35",
                        "entry_id": "cf36fe02-a9a2-307d-b059-82ec121c1063",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cycle à deux ou trois roues, dont le châssis est conçu pour recevoir une caisse ou une plateforme permettant le transport de charges, voire d’enfants."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf6fa8de-c992-4392-9a11-e67c3f1e2560",
                                "sense_id": "bcb53acb-730f-38c1-852a-b4e7d835da35",
                                "text": "Quand l’envie leur prend, ils enfourchent leur vélo-cargo, transportent leur sound system, et débarquent à l’improviste."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2223d230-4a91-444f-ba3d-5e4ed2fc4f55",
                                "sense_id": "bcb53acb-730f-38c1-852a-b4e7d835da35",
                                "text": "Le travail avec les utilisateurs de vélos-cargos a permis de repérer les endroits critiques pour éviter les resserrements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "199349a9-cb8a-46dc-9a5d-97f2858bf08b",
                                "sense_id": "bcb53acb-730f-38c1-852a-b4e7d835da35",
                                "text": "Ainsi, nous expérimentons à Lyon des livraisons de gros volume, comme des machines à laver, en vélos-cargos, avec une start-up qui s’appelle Fends la bise."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be604595-6fd4-4cb9-849a-dd4b2820a530",
                                "sense_id": "bcb53acb-730f-38c1-852a-b4e7d835da35",
                                "text": "Omniprésents aux Pays-Bas, les vélos-cargos, ou «bakfiets» en néerlandais, disposent d'une grande caisse en bois à l'avant pour transporter enfants, chiens ou colis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dbbcc4a-dcf5-47c1-8a32-7030435a2248",
                                "sense_id": "bcb53acb-730f-38c1-852a-b4e7d835da35",
                                "text": "Par la force des choses nous roulions très lentement et fûmes obligés de nous relayer de temps à autre sur le vélo-cargo"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2bd2d59-f1f7-4989-85bb-a75b7c951ad1",
                        "source_entry_id": "cf36fe02-a9a2-307d-b059-82ec121c1063",
                        "source_sense_id": "bcb53acb-730f-38c1-852a-b4e7d835da35",
                        "target_lang_word": "cargo bike",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cargo bike",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b0e9c8d-2e45-37cc-b321-fb5bc4968d7b",
                                        "entry_id": "1bc5d141-6154-3fbd-b842-5f748fdc3d04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bicycle designed for carrying large or heavy loads; by extension, any other pedal cycle such as a tricycle or quadricycle designed in this way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80bc5d6f-6778-4e32-bf08-10b459882972",
                                                "sense_id": "0b0e9c8d-2e45-37cc-b321-fb5bc4968d7b",
                                                "text": "Demand for electric cargo bike couriers has boomed since first lockdown, bringing the hope of cleaner, quieter, safer streets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec1a934f-318e-43b9-af44-d7d487af880e",
                                                "sense_id": "0b0e9c8d-2e45-37cc-b321-fb5bc4968d7b",
                                                "text": "It develops a use case in which an electrified three-wheeled cargo bike will become an on-demand, shared autonomous vehicle for the city."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cb1d0e4-60c3-40d3-ba24-43db2d318729",
                                                "sense_id": "0b0e9c8d-2e45-37cc-b321-fb5bc4968d7b",
                                                "text": "Zero-emission zones and zero-fatality cities have eliminated the last-mile advantages of moving goods by road. The need for transshipment from trucks to vans or cargo bikes at the fringes of the urban core has meant that road has lost the advantage it held over rail for so much of the last 100 years."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
